# Cushion for Content

`padding` creates space between the content and the border. It's transparent and uses the element's background.

You can set each side individually:
- `padding-top`, `padding-right`, `padding-bottom`, `padding-left`

Or use the **shorthand**:
```css
/* all four sides */
padding: 20px;
/* top/bottom 20px, left/right 10px */
padding: 20px 10px;
/* top 10px, right 20px, bottom 30px, left 5px (TRouBLe clockwise) */
padding: 10px 20px 30px 5px;
```
Padding values cannot be negative.

